{
    "version": "6.5.1800.0",
    "description": "The 7-Zip derivative intended for the modern Windows experience",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/M2Team/NanaZip",
    "license": "MIT",
    "notes": [
        "babylon 定制版（相对 main bucket）变更说明：",
        "1. 背景：main manifest 的 pre_install 会删除 *.msix 包文件，导致 MSIX 包身份丢失，",
        "   依赖包身份声明的右键上下文菜单（windows.fileExplorerContextMenus）无法挂载，",
        "   Win11 新旧菜单均不显示；注册表本身并无写入限制。",
        "2. 修改：pre_install 保留当前架构的 .msix；post_install 通过 Add-AppxPackage 注册官方包",
        "   （包身份 40174MouriNaruto.NanaZip），由系统包管理器写入 Shell 扩展注册表项；",
        "   uninstaller 对称移除包，卸载后无注册表残留；scoop update 时先移除旧版本包再注册新版。",
        "3. 便携文件（NanaZip.Universal.Console.exe 等）仍保留于 scoop 目录，7z/7zG shim 不受影响；",
        "   开始菜单入口由 AppX 包提供（故不再创建 scoop shortcut）。",
        "4. 若不再需要包注册（恢复 main 行为），删除 post_install/uninstaller 并在 pre_install 恢复删除 '*.msix' 即可。",
        "5. 零 7zip 解包：URL 不带 '#/dl.7z' 片段，pre_install 改用 .NET 内置 [System.IO.Compression.ZipFile]",
        "   原生嵌套解包（msixbundle 与 msix 均为 ZIP/OPC 结构），全程不依赖任何 7z 可执行文件——",
        "   首装无自举死锁，自身更新时旧 shim 被 rm_shims 正常删除也不影响解包，因此 bin 恢复标准声明，",
        "   scoop reset/uninstall 的 shim 生命周期回归 scoop 常规行为，不再需要 depends 7zip 或任何补丁逻辑。",
        "6. use_external_7zip=true 下：安装/更新本应用全程不触碰 7z 代码路径；",
        "   其他应用解压仍按 scoop 原逻辑走 Get-Command 7z（指向本应用的 shim 或 AppX 执行别名）。"
    ],
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/M2Team/NanaZip/releases/download/6.5.1800.0/NanaZip_6.5.1800.0.msixbundle",
            "hash": "0c2648eb0f52a52697fd9c3efa8fd292226c76817e0ce7f87444b91ed9593012"
        },
        "arm64": {
            "url": "https://github.com/M2Team/NanaZip/releases/download/6.5.1800.0/NanaZip_6.5.1800.0.msixbundle",
            "hash": "0c2648eb0f52a52697fd9c3efa8fd292226c76817e0ce7f87444b91ed9593012"
        }
    },
    "bin": [
        [
            "NanaZip.Universal.Console.exe",
            "7z"
        ],
        [
            "NanaZip.Universal.Windows.exe",
            "7zG"
        ]
    ],
    "pre_install": [
        "# 零 7zip 解包：用 .NET 内置 ZipFile 替代 Expand-7zipArchive（msixbundle/msix 均为 ZIP/OPC 结构）",
        "Add-Type -AssemblyName System.IO.Compression.FileSystem",
        "$archShort = switch ($architecture) { '64bit' { 'x64' } 'arm64' { 'arm64' } }",
        "$bundle = Get-ChildItem -Path \"$dir\" -Filter '*.msixbundle' | Select-Object -First 1",
        "$bundleTmp = \"$dir\\__bundle_tmp\"",
        "[System.IO.Compression.ZipFile]::ExtractToDirectory($bundle.FullName, $bundleTmp)",
        "$msix = Get-ChildItem -Path $bundleTmp -Filter \"*_$archShort.msix\" | Select-Object -First 1",
        "Move-Item -Path $msix.FullName -Destination \"$dir\" -Force",
        "[System.IO.Compression.ZipFile]::ExtractToDirectory((Get-ChildItem -Path \"$dir\" -Filter '*.msix' | Select-Object -First 1).FullName, \"$dir\")",
        "Remove-Item -Path $bundleTmp, $bundle.FullName -Recurse -Force",
        "Remove-Item -Path \"$dir\\*\" -Include 'Appx*', '?Content*', 'Code*' -Recurse -Force"
    ],
    "post_install": [
        "Get-AppxPackage -Name '40174MouriNaruto.NanaZip' | Remove-AppxPackage -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue",
        "Add-AppxPackage -Path (Get-ChildItem -Path \"$dir\" -Filter '*.msix' | Select-Object -First 1 -ExpandProperty FullName) -ErrorAction Stop"
    ],
    "uninstaller": {
        "script": "Get-AppxPackage -Name '40174MouriNaruto.NanaZip' | Remove-AppxPackage -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue"
    },
    "checkver": "github",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/M2Team/NanaZip/releases/download/$version/NanaZip_$version.msixbundle",
        "hash": {
            "url": "https://github.com/M2Team/NanaZip/releases/tag/$version",
            "regex": "(?s)$basename.*?$sha256"
        }
    }
}
